# ---- Elixir / Mix build artifacts ----
# Compiled output and fetched deps (umbrella root + nested per-app copies)
/_build/
/deps/
**/_build/
**/deps/

# Mix fetch cache
/.fetch
**/.fetch

# Crash dumps
erl_crash.dump

# Generated docs (ExDoc)
/doc/
**/doc/

# Test coverage output
/cover/
**/cover/

# ---- Tooling / editor caches ----
# ElixirLS language server cache
/.elixir_ls/
**/.elixir_ls/
.elixir-tools/

# ---- Secrets / local env ----
**/*.secret.exs
.env

# ---- OS cruft ----
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# ---- Project-specific build/export artifacts ----
# HMI export bundle (regenerated; not source)
exmo_hmi.zip
*.zip

# Stray compiled BEAM files outside _build
*.beam

# Local controller state: dev credential database and self-signed TLS material.
.emotion/
.fuse_hidden*
